OL,3,AScreams, haunting scenes and deadly
OL,4,Ahide-and-seek, as Celebrity Traitors
OL,5,Aheats up
OL,6,
OL,7,FFriday evening's episode saw the
OL,8,FTraitors at it again, murdering Last of
OL,9,FUs actor Bella Ramsey, before the
OL,10,Ffaithfuls did their dirty work for them
OL,11,Fby banishing another of their own,
OL,12,FJulie Hesmondhalgh.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
